0..76 Comment "// A pattern hole leaves the arm that runs undecided: the match\'s tree has a"
77..155 Comment "// leaf no arm owns, so the match is not shown to cover its scrutinee, and the"
156..226 Comment "// checker refuses it by name. The twin in `model/holes/` writes every"
227..234 Comment "// arm."
